# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Movio build artefacts.
# These are regenerated by `python train_model.py` and are far too
# large for git (the raw downloads alone are ~210 MB). The catalogue
# is derived data; the datasets are third-party and should be fetched
# from their own sources, not vendored here.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
Movio_final_code/data/
Movio_final_code/model/*.joblib
Movio_final_code/model/*.npz
Movio_final_code/model/metrics.json
!Movio_final_code/model/README.txt

